<newsitem itemid="190536" id="root" date="1996-11-14" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Bank Danamon launches US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank Danamon launches US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK DANAMON INDONESIA THROUGH CAYMAN ISLANDS BR</p>
<p> AMT	US$100 MLN COUPON     6ML+90 SA  MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  RE-OFFER    PAR</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	 CALLS	NONE	 PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING  HONG KONG  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS	$10/500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  BA2*	 LIMITS  UK/HK/S'PORE/INDONESIA/US NOT 144A</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	  CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  INDONESIA  TAX PROV    ---</p>
<p> FEES     30 BP AS** MGT,UND    10 BP	SELLING     20 BP</p>
<p> LEADS    MERRILL LYNCH INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p> NOTES    A GROUP IS BEING FORMED. CO-LEAD MANAGERS FOR</p>
<p>	    US$5-7 MLN, CO-MANAGERS FOR US$3-4 MLN</p>
<p>	    *ISSUER RATING. **ALL-IN TO THE PUT 100 BP. THERE</p>
<p>	    IS A PREACIPIUM OF 20 BP TO THE LEAD MANAGER ONLY.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
